- Ensure `pen.done` after finish.
- `afterPenaltyKick()`:
```
const pen=this.pen; update message
const remainingH=Math.max(0,5-pen.homeKicks), etc.
const decided = (pen.homeKicks>=5 && pen.awayKicks>=5 && pen.home!==pen.away) || pen.home > pen.away+remainingA || pen.away > pen.home+remainingH;
if((pen.homeKicks>=5||pen.awayKicks>=5) && pen.homeKicks===pen.awayKicks && pen.home!==pen.away) decided true;
if(decided){pen.done=true; this.ui.penaltyResult(pen.home>pen.away?'BRASIL WIN!':'...'); pen.wait=1.5; pen.after=()=>this.finishMatch(pen.home>pen.away); return;}
pen.turn = pen.homeKicks<=pen.awayKicks?'home':'away'; // Actually alternation.
pen.round = Math.floor(Math.min(pen.homeKicks,pen.awayKicks))+1;
pen.phase = pen.turn==='home'?'kick':'dive';
pen.message = ...
this.penaltyUI(); pen.wait=.35; pen.after=null; // or setPenalty immediate
```
Wait, how to decide next turn is tricky. Use sequence: home,away,home,away. After a home kick, if homeKicks>awayKicks then next away. After away kick equal -> home. So:
`pen.turn = pen.homeKicks <= pen.awayKicks ? 'home' : 'away'`. Yes.
- Early decision formula:
  - `remainingH = max(0,5-homeKicks)`, remainingA.
  - If homeKicks===5 and awayKicks===5: decided if score diff; else sudden.
  - If home > away + remainingA: home wins.
  - If away > home + remainingH: away wins.
  - But when both have kicked 5 and tie, sudden death, continue.
  - Sudden death after both >=5 and equal kicks, compare diff; if diff -> decided.
  - After 5 each tied: turn home. Keep.
- `pen.round` for sudden >5: `Math.max(5, Math.min(homeKicks, awayKicks)+1)`.
- message: home 'PICK YOUR CORNER' / away 'PICK YOUR DIVE'? UI setPenalty uses phase to prompt, and message for hint. Set message.
- On finish, `this.finishMatch(pen.home>pen.away)` and result penalties from pen.
