if(this.input.take('pause')) return; // no pause
if(!this.pen.wait && this.pen.turn==='home') handle opt1..3? maybe.
if(pen.wait>0){pen.wait-=dt;if<=0){const f=pen.after;pen.after=null;f?.();}}
```
Wait for input when turn. Map keys 1/2/3 to left/center/right if no wait and !done.
- `ui.setPenalty` disables if animating false. We pass false. During wait buttons remain enabled! But choosePenalty checks wait>0, okay. Fine.

